## 4. Professional Dashboard Subpages (`src/components/ProfessionalDashboardSubpages.tsx`)
This registers a fully-featured standalone workspace for individual engineers, architects, and quantity surveyors, loaded with specific target defaults (2 active projects, 3 requests, 2 quotes, and ₦180,000 earnings), integrated drawing uploads, and persistent `localStorage` syncing.

```tsx
// Implemented full workspace modules:
// - Professional Dashboard Home: Welcome Banner, Summary Cards, Pending Requests, Earnings Analytics, Drawing request board.
